# The build context for `example/gateway/Dockerfile` is this directory, because that image
# compiles the framework from source. Everything below would be sent to the daemon on every
# build and used by none of it.
#
# `dist` in particular is excluded rather than reused: the image builds its own inside the
# container, so a stale one from the host would be silently preferred to nothing at all.
.git
node_modules
dist
example/state
.scratch
